    <h2 style="color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:20px">Instructions Before Your Health Check-Up</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom:25px">To ensure accurate test results, please follow these guidelines before your health check-up:</p>
    <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:25px">
      <li style="margin-bottom:12px">Fasting for 10–12 hours before the check-up (water is permitted)</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:12px">Bring all previous medical records, reports, and current medications list</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:12px">Wear comfortable, loose clothing</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:12px">Avoid alcohol for at least 24 hours before the check-up</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:12px">Bring a valid ID proof and insurance card (if applicable)</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:12px">Inform the doctor about any ongoing medications or allergies</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:12px">For TMT (Treadmill Test), wear comfortable shoes and clothes</li>
    </ul>
    <div style="margin-top:30px;text-align:center">
